      "id": 1,
      "text": "Graceville got its name from the railway station christened on 4 February 1875 after Grace Grimes, daughter of local member Samuel Grimes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
